msgid ""
"I work at the scale the problem requires: from removing a focused "
"productivity bottleneck to building larger systems that dramatically reduce "
"time spent on operational work."
msgstr ""
"Trabajo al nivel que el problema exige: desde resolver un bloqueo puntual de "
"productividad hasta construir sistemas de mayor alcance que reduzcan "
"drásticamente el tiempo dedicado a tareas operativas."

